<title>HONG KONG: New World 1997 sales at HK$13 bln - paper.</title>
<headline>New World 1997 sales at HK$13 bln - paper.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong-based property developer New World Development Co Ltd expects to generate total property sales revenue of HK$13 billion this year, the South China Morning Post said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The newspaper was quoting sales and marketing senior manager Barbara Ho.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
